graph TD
    A[User Message] --> B[Input Guardrails]

    B -->|PII detected| B1[Redact PII]
    B1 --> B
    B -->|Injection detected| BLOCK[Block Response → END]
    B -->|Clean| C[Router]

    C -->|faq / greeting| D[Knowledge Agent]
    C -->|complex_query / complaint| E[Analyst Agent]
    C -->|escalation / high urgency| F[Escalation]
    C -->|out_of_scope| G[Output Guardrails]

    D -->|confidence >= 0.4| G
    D -->|confidence < 0.4| F

    E -->|confidence >= 0.4| G
    E -->|confidence < 0.4| F

    F --> G

    G --> H[Final Response to User]

    D -.->|RAG| DB[(ChromaDB\n12 docs)]
    E -.->|Tools| T1[check_order_status]
    E -.->|Tools| T2[calculate_billing]
    E -.->|Tools| T3[check_service_status]

    style B fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style G fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style C fill:#4ecdc4,color:#fff
    style D fill:#45b7d1,color:#fff
    style E fill:#45b7d1,color:#fff
    style F fill:#f9ca24,color:#333
    style BLOCK fill:#c0392b,color:#fff
